<!-- Project Onyx v1 drug dealing zones.
     Zone codes from the ZoneReps dictionary in reference material reference\reference implementation
     (all 89 entries kept verbatim - the dictionary contains 89 zone codes, not 88).
     Per-zone rep: starts 0, clamped 0-100 (AdjustZoneRep). RepGainPerSale=3, RepGainRivalDefeated=5,
     RepLossPerFailedSale=1.
     Order-size curves (traffic-stop reference Get*BuyAmount, size = Base + TotalRep/OrderRepDivisor * RepBonus,
     clamped Min..Max; TotalRep = sum of all zone reps):
       weed: 6 + rep/13000*78, clamp 6-84    coke: 3 + rep/13000*39, clamp 1-42
       pills: 2 + rep/13000*26, clamp 1-28
